    given-names: C. Wayne
date-released: 2026-11-02
version: v1.1
repository-code: "https://github.com/CWBaker360/ramanujan-pi-nseries-geometric-constant"
url: "https://github.com/CWBaker360/ramanujan-pi-nseries-geometric-constant"
abstract: >-
  A guarded structural comparison between Ramanujan-type modular and
  hypergeometric acceleration for pi and polygonal N-Series scale
  cancellation. High-precision tests verify the raw, two-scale, and
  three-scale convergence orders 2, 4, and 6.
keywords:
  - Ramanujan
  - pi
